<title>PORTUGAL: SOCCER-SUMMARY IN THE PORTUGUESE FIRST DIVISION.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SUMMARY IN THE PORTUGUESE FIRST DIVISION.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of an match played in</p>
<p>the Portuguese first division championship on Friday:</p>
<p>Belenenses 2 - Antonio Tonanha 37, Rui Esteves 39 Sporting 2 -</p>
